1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,757
Participle adjectives.

2
00:00:01,757 --> 00:00:08,033
The ing form describes what causes the feeling; the ed form describes the person who has it.

3
00:00:08,033 --> 00:00:11,510
The journey was tiring; the passengers were tired.

4
00:00:11,510 --> 00:00:13,945
The film was boring; we were bored.

5
00:00:13,945 --> 00:00:17,955
The result was disappointing; her parents were disappointed.

6
00:00:17,955 --> 00:00:21,067
An interesting lecture; an interested listener.

7
00:00:21,067 --> 00:00:24,101
A frightening noise; a frightened child.

